{"summary":"Control your survivors and manage your shelter. Craft weapons and items.","description":"This War of Mine: Stories - Father's Promise\n\nExpand your This War of Mine journey with This War of Mine: Stories Ep 1: Father's Promise. A standalone game that offers a brand new, distinctive experience with additional game mechanics and several hours of thought-provoking gameplay. It tells a story of a family’s struggle to preserve the last pieces of humanity in times of despair and cruelty.\n\nBecome Adam - a father trying to save his daughter from the horrors of war and leave the besieged city. Follow their steps and discover a story of love, hate and sacrifice - the emotions we all share in the darkest of days.\n\nThe Father's Promise features:\n- A harrowing storyline based on an audio-drama by famous Polish author, Łukasz Orbitowski\n- Emotionally difficult experience - decisions that are often morally ambiguous\n- Crafting, cooking, taking care of people - anything that helps to survive\n- Locations exclusively made for this standalone expansion\n- Remastered and enhanced visuals from the original This War of Mine","esrbNotes":"Violence, Blood, Sexual Themes, Strong Language","pegiNotes":"Extreme Violence, Strong Language","iapPrices":null,"video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/iTQWkS-syR0?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/hOAVnZWi0QliwTnIGOHKkKbVL5KNArxURlHR3IIq1MGpWhftDJNsogd7jsGHu6Pn0s1fkMsbsc8twr3JkiyTLHE","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/dKbRyWYQzmf22e7yf-ADF719bwAO1r7vaMa5a7qzaT42DfV0l7ygzNptdThecsw3yJHjCncDH0GoVyxa6PuBuw","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/1r5ppvTLH4m82C4o815IcJ9zXaU0YlCZ9jf87qI0hX559ai-GssYGW35sC5puECr-bRka5C3HL0clH78JDMN","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Xp8qLQ9OvKJeEe2WsQu2RhJbejBzsxQ_OctEWKNxYa6i-gGQBvCQy4dpRq5lAZGUEfkqTWWk5un46p1GgShYFg","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/N_JAXF4_20zSnn-_htDfI7CGse-pCZ_4H9JniUQ4AtYLI93xfKXwZE9ltM7X8Au9VWifwY1z